{"id":"wb-3-137","name":"净藏禅师塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"净藏禅师塔","text":"净藏禅师塔位于中国河南省登封市嵩山南麓的会善寺西侧，是会善寺僧人净藏禅师的墓塔，是中国现存唯一一座唐代八角仿木结构砖塔，1988年被列为第三批全国重点文物保护单位。\n从塔身上的铭文可知净藏禅师于唐天宝五年（746年）圆寂后，其弟子为其建此塔。塔由地宫、基座、塔身、塔顶四部分组成，高10.35米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%87%80%E8%97%8F%E7%A6%85%E5%B8%88%E5%A1%94","revisionId":85959684,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85959684","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7770d3d80a6be789c1feff51.jpg","title":"登封净藏禅师塔.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%99%BB%E5%B0%81%E5%87%80%E8%97%8F%E7%A6%85%E5%B8%88%E5%A1%94.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7a/%E7%99%BB%E5%B0%81%E5%87%80%E8%97%8F%E7%A6%85%E5%B8%88%E5%A1%94.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Acot一杯茶","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​登封净藏禅师塔是会善寺的附属建筑，建于唐代。它属于一位被尊称为净藏禅师的高僧。","width":320,"height":483}}